# These two files are the CSP hash gate's input and a browser's input, so keep them boring:
# LF in the index and LF in every checkout. The gate normalizes newlines itself, the way HTML's
# input-stream preprocessing does, so this pin is not what makes it correct. It just stops the
# two files drifting between platforms for no reason.
site/index.html text eol=lf
site/_headers text eol=lf
